<title>BELGIUM: PetroFina sees 15 bln bfr 96 profit - paper.</title>
<headline>PetroFina sees 15 bln bfr 96 profit - paper.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian oil group Petrofina expects to earn a consolidated 1996 profit of 15 billion Belgian francs and a cashflow of 43 billion francs, PetroFina chief executive officer Francois Cornelis told Belgian daily De Standaard in an interview on Tuesday.</p>
<p>PetroFina earned a 1995 consolidated net profit of 11.61 billion francs and a cash flow of 39.32 billion francs.  </p>
<p>Petrofina officials were not immediately available to confirm Cornelis' comment.</p>
